<!--meta {"lead": "Move between bounded result pages.", "description": "Move between bounded result pages.", "variants": "numbered, previous and next, page size", "states": "default, hover, focus, active, disabled, current", "sources": ["pages/style-gallery/long"], "pills": ["Extracted"]} -->
<section class="ds-section" id="overview"><h2><a href="#overview">Overview</a></h2><p>Move between bounded result pages. This component appears in <a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/long.html">pages/style-gallery/long</a>.</p><p>Use it for this job; choose a different component when the interaction or information hierarchy changes.</p></section>

<section class="ds-section" id="anatomy"><h2><a href="#anatomy">Anatomy</a></h2><div class="ds-anatomy"><figure class="ds-anatomy__figure"><nav class="pagination" aria-label="Pagination"><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/default.html">Previous</a><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/long.html" aria-current="page">2</a><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/long.html">Next</a></nav></figure><ol class="ds-anatomy__list"><li><div><b>Semantic element</b><small>Preserves the native role and browser interaction.</small></div></li><li><div><b>Visible content</b><small>Names the action, value, or status in plain language.</small></div></li><li><div><b>Component class</b><small>Reads shared roles from the token stylesheet.</small></div></li></ol></div></section>

<section class="ds-section" id="variants"><h2><a href="#variants">Variants</a></h2><p>Choose the variant by meaning and context. Keep status or action labels explicit.</p><ul><li><strong>Numbered</strong> — use this form when the surrounding content calls for numbered presentation.</li><li><strong>Previous and next</strong> — use this form when the surrounding content calls for previous and next presentation.</li><li><strong>Page size</strong> — use this form when the surrounding content calls for page size presentation.</li></ul>{{example:Base specimen}}<nav class="pagination" aria-label="Pagination"><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/default.html">Previous</a><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/long.html" aria-current="page">2</a><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/long.html">Next</a></nav>{{/example}}</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="sizes" data-na="This component has one size; it adapts through content and layout tokens."><h2><a href="#sizes">Sizes</a></h2></section>

<section class="ds-section" id="states"><h2><a href="#states">States</a></h2><p>The table forces pointer and focus states with <code>data-state</code> for review. Production interactions use native attributes and pseudo-classes.</p><div class="ds-matrix"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Specimen</th><th scope="col">default</th><th scope="col">hover</th><th scope="col">focus</th><th scope="col">active</th><th scope="col">disabled</th><th scope="col">current</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Pagination</th><td><nav class="pagination" aria-label="Pagination"><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/default.html">Previous</a><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/long.html" aria-current="page">2</a><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/long.html">Next</a></nav></td><td><nav class="pagination" aria-label="Pagination"><a data-state="hover" href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/default.html">Previous</a><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/long.html" aria-current="page">2</a><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/long.html">Next</a></nav></td><td><nav class="pagination" aria-label="Pagination"><a data-state="focus" href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/default.html">Previous</a><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/long.html" aria-current="page">2</a><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/long.html">Next</a></nav></td><td><nav class="pagination" aria-label="Pagination"><a data-state="active" href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/default.html">Previous</a><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/long.html" aria-current="page">2</a><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/long.html">Next</a></nav></td><td><nav class="pagination" aria-label="Pagination"><a data-state="disabled" href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/default.html">Previous</a><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/long.html" aria-current="page">2</a><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/long.html">Next</a></nav></td><td><nav class="pagination" aria-label="Pagination"><a data-state="current" href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/default.html">Previous</a><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/long.html" aria-current="page">2</a><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/long.html">Next</a></nav></td></tr></tbody></table></div>{{themes}}<nav class="pagination" aria-label="Pagination"><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/default.html">Previous</a><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/long.html" aria-current="page">2</a><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/long.html">Next</a></nav>{{/themes}}</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="responsive"><h2><a href="#responsive">Responsive</a></h2><p>Preserve Previous and Next on narrow screens; collapse the numbered range when space is limited.</p></section>

<section class="ds-section" id="theming"><h2><a href="#theming">Theming</a></h2><p>The same markup appears in light and dark themes. Use the semantic roles in the token table; override a component token only for a local variation.</p>{{themes}}<nav class="pagination" aria-label="Pagination"><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/default.html">Previous</a><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/long.html" aria-current="page">2</a><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/long.html">Next</a></nav>{{/themes}}</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="accessibility"><h2><a href="#accessibility">Accessibility</a></h2><h3>Role and keyboard</h3><p>Tab and Shift+Tab follow DOM order; Enter or Space activates native controls, while links use Enter. Static content remains in reading order.</p><h3>Focus and labelling</h3><p>Keep the shared visible focus ring. The visible text supplies the accessible name; icon-only actions need an explicit label. Associate help and errors with the relevant control.</p><h3>Contrast, motion, and touch</h3><p>Text uses a 4.5:1 minimum, meaningful controls and focus boundaries use 3:1, and all actions keep a 24px minimum target with comfortable spacing. Reduced motion removes decorative transitions. Check the actual foreground and background pair in both themes on the <a href="../foundations/color.html">Color foundation</a>.</p></section>

<section class="ds-section" id="content"><h2><a href="#content">Content</a></h2><p>Use sentence case. For pagination, keep the wording concrete and close to the value or action it describes. Show “Awaiting reply” until the braider accepts; label a price estimate as an estimate.</p></section>

<section class="ds-section" id="do-dont"><h2><a href="#do-dont">Do dont</a></h2><div class="ds-dodont"><figure class="ds-do"><div class="ds-example__canvas"><nav class="pagination" aria-label="Pagination"><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/default.html">Previous</a><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/long.html" aria-current="page">2</a><a href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/long.html">Next</a></nav></div><figcaption>Use the pagination for its stated job: move between bounded result pages.</figcaption></figure><figure class="ds-dont"><div class="ds-example__canvas"><span class="text-muted">Unclear action</span></div><figcaption>Do not replace the semantic element with unlabelled text or a decorative shape.</figcaption></figure><figure class="ds-do"><div class="ds-example__canvas"><span class="badge badge--warning">Awaiting reply</span></div><figcaption>Pair colour with an explicit state label.</figcaption></figure><figure class="ds-dont"><div class="ds-example__canvas"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><figcaption>Do not make colour or a dot the only carrier of status.</figcaption></figure></div></section>

<section class="ds-section" id="tokens"><h2><a href="#tokens">Tokens</a></h2><div class="ds-table-wrap"><table class="ds-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Part</th><th scope="col">Token</th><th scope="col">Light</th><th scope="col">Dark</th></tr></thead><tbody>{{tok:Color accent subtle|--color-accent-subtle}}{{tok:Color fg accent|--color-fg-accent}}{{tok:Target min|--target-min}}</tbody></table></div></section>

<section class="ds-section" id="code"><h2><a href="#code">Code</a></h2><p>Copy the semantic markup and product class; replace the sample content with real data.</p><pre><code>&lt;nav class=&quot;pagination&quot; aria-label=&quot;Pagination&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/default.html&quot;&gt;Previous&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/long.html&quot; aria-current=&quot;page&quot;&gt;2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/long.html&quot;&gt;Next&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/nav&gt;</code></pre><p>Forced <code>data-state</code> values are for documentation snapshots only.</p></section>

<section class="ds-section" id="sources"><h2><a href="#sources">Sources</a></h2><ul>{{mock:pages/style-gallery/long|visible specimen}}</ul><p>The examples use the corresponding selectors in <a href="../assets/components.css">components.css</a>.</p></section>
